{"server":"cn","storyId":"act27side_level_act27side_05_end","groupId":"act27side","stageId":"act27side_05","title":"我会唱一首彩虹","storyCode":"SL-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"3cf8d33e77999304d8cb21c46596b4fc91d14b0710abe322e74387fb3bbb35e7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么还在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在拿到你们所有人的签字之前，我都要像一只海滩上的四爪磐蟹一样赖在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那你赖着吧。我要收摊回家跟自己喝一杯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我从那个集市上买到了个新鲜玩意，好像是叫什么“源石微波按摩仪”，哥伦比亚的，弄不明白，但还挺好用，贴在腰上确实舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尝试一下新鲜事物也不是坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长毛循兽骑着冲浪板在屋顶冲浪的那个节目也是你们搞的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长毛循兽？不，那个不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，我还挺喜欢那个的。没有了黑曜石音乐节之后，难得见到这么有趣的节目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴能取悦到您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，送你一个东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拇指琴？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是您从白天的集市上买来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新婚快乐，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了家人找了个稳定的工作，虽然是无聊了点，倒也算有责任心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能理解你喜欢安定，可是生活的方式总有很多种，别让自己过得太狼狈了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人只要活着就够狼狈了......随遇而安吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候和你爷爷打赌，说你总有一天能去黑曜石音乐节拿一个大奖回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......白瞎了那么好的音乐天赋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等您有心情的时候，我也可以把旧吉他搬出来，再弹给您听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你早拿出吉他弹上一曲，说不定我早就在那张表上签字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉太太，这里丢的冲浪板我们帮您找回来了，您看看数量对不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帮了我的忙，怎么反而跟我道歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几件东西，我还以为再也派不上用场了。真奇怪，到底是谁拿走的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那个，我也不是很清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，孩子，说不定是一些游客玩得太开心顺手拿去玩了玩，都找回来就行了。那你呢？你今天玩得开心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是指被温泉水浇个湿透吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也算是找回了一点在海边玩水的感觉？好久没这么闹过了，连来喝酒的客人脸上都是笑眯眯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前那几个店主天天苦着一张脸，酒都变难喝了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈莉看向店外还没有散去的游客，夕阳渐渐染红天空，每个人都很快乐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像是回到了好几年前啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人缓缓走向陈旧的咖啡馆，又一次推开门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他摸索着打开电闸，用抹布仔细将吧台上的灰尘抹去，又从柜子里拿出器具，再从怀中摸出一包从办公室带回来的新鲜咖啡豆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像许多年前一样，烧水，磨粉，仔细注水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这味道......还是手生了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看向窗外，人们趁着夕阳陆陆续续回了家，街道渐渐趋于冷落，直到街上空无一人，他才发出一声自嘲的苦笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是......我到底在等什么。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他喝完咖啡，准备收拾东西离开这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一阵敲门声传来。科斯达记得自己并没有将店门关上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，这里还营业吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，你真的已经和小黑羊们说清楚了，不能再这样捣乱了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......再捣乱的话，我会否认他们是我的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在半空中打滚）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的生物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（冲撞着街边的墙）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多利先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我会尽力的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（试图安静地行走）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，是不是好多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是今天的博览会它们还是造成了不小的混乱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是空气里全都是快乐的味道，嗯，到现在都还是甜甜的。这种感觉就和我第一次在你们所说的“国家”之间行走的时候一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多山的地区可以滑翔，有水的地区可以冲浪，荒野里还有几个烦人的崽子追着我到处跑，每个地方产出的东西也不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能看到这些有趣的事，对于你们这些并不能四处游历的人类来说，很新奇吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么感觉多利先生是在炫耀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被发现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你今天玩得怎么样呢，阿黛尔？温泉可以放松，滑板很刺激，来自那只吵闹企鹅的吵闹音乐有没有让你觉得激动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，那些小朋友们可是能看得到小羊的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，让你高兴起来，怎么就这么难呢？空气中又出现了那种叫做“伤心”的又苦又涩的味道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛尔转过脸去偷偷笑了一下，随即又正色起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，我们到了。我要和店主先生留张纸条说明一下，展品已经找到了，辛苦他为我们留心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纸和笔都在包里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这家咖啡店......是又开业了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"昏黄的灯光充溢在房间里，透过窗子，咖啡店中的陈设微茫可见。\n科斯达将热水倾倒出来，声音划破他与客人之间的沉默。\n水汽漫上窗子，阿黛尔轻轻拭去玻璃上温泉吹来的白雾，她终于看清了那位客人的模样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么停下了？我们不是要进去喝咖啡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯勒老师？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"《泰拉火山图志》我收到了，没想到你居然妥善保管了这么多年......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是我托一个小姑娘还回去的。她来这里找一个什么展品，正好是火山博物馆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个，她是你的员工吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛尔是我的学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你的学生。嗯，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你最近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......狼狈的市政厅的职员，正在收集这里居民在搬迁意向书上的签字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里还有我父母留下来的一小间服装店，按理说，我也需要在意向书上签字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你......对这里的改建有什么异议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很早之前家里就不再靠这个维生了。如果这能方便你的工作的话......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，谢谢配合......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要来一杯咖啡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那还能提供以前的聊天服务吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为一个合格的咖啡师，倾听也是工作的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，请坐吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不我们走吧，多利先生？今天看来不是很适合留言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，可是咖啡很香，我们不喝咖啡吗......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1008_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（准备一头冲进咖啡厅）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......欸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"关上的玻璃门阻挡住了小羊的撞击，它也并未像想象中那样发出巨大的声音，它只是向后旋转着弹飞出去，滚落在街上。\n阿黛尔紧张地观察着店内两人的反应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当时为什么突然就走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我遇到了两个......很有趣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想要研究火山，总要去更多地方看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，你们那时候常常在这里碰面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，只要他俩来店里，你就会把吉他插上电，开始你吵闹的重金属表演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玛格娜一直感觉“咖啡店里的那个小男孩”，好像有点不太欢迎他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我那时候，就是有点太随心所欲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也不是针对他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。他们也没有放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那时你给他们尝咖啡气泡水，还让我们给你保密，不要告诉知更鸟爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷一点都看不上我那些自创饮料，我在菜单上加上几次他就要擦掉几次......他觉得那和我的电吉他、架子鼓一样奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"顺便一提，那可不是普通的咖啡气泡水，它的名字是“火山咖啡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，是“火山咖啡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过确实挺好喝的，我们去了莱塔尼亚以后，卡提亚还常常按照你的配方，自己复刻那种风味呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡提亚......和玛格娜......他们现在怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，你在离开汐斯塔时说过，你会和他们一起走遍大地上的每一座火山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在旅程中，我与他们同行了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......但是几年前，我和他们走散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走散？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且我们永远无法重逢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是因为......？我很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我回到这里，开始建那座博物馆，希望能保留下他们当年所研究的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那天，在博物馆遇见你，完全......完全出乎我的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也很意外，你和我印象里的那个吵小孩也完全不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也是......你现在都已经是博物馆的馆长了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，算是实现了曾经的理想吧。只不过，支撑我做下去的信念，和最开始又有一些不同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，改变不完全是个坏事，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人沉默了一会儿，客人轻轻搅动着杯中的咖啡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去了今天的博览会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博览会？我去了。游客多了起来，店主们都很开心，好像之前的汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许等这个地方重建好，等游客多起来，我对我的以后也会有一点新想法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比如？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢......？可能继续开一家咖啡店，但是是摇滚咖啡店，或者就是乐器店，在里面摆满架子鼓和电吉他。总会有人喜欢这些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的......就像之前的汐斯塔那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，今天还有一件很有意思的事，我在那个商品博览会上，见到了一种来自哥伦比亚的饮料，配方和“火山咖啡”一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可不是我把你的秘方泄露出去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是不是，在一年前打算关停这家店的时候，我也跟别人说过“火山咖啡”的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但其实......也就是咖啡加苏打水罢了。当然也有可能是哥伦比亚人自己发明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手冲咖啡加苏打水，你当时是怎么想到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小时候觉得咖啡那么苦，肯定要加点什么才能喝得下去啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"会在店里大弹摇滚乐的人居然也会怕苦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候哪里会在意这些事啊？"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯勒笑了起来，喝光了最后一口咖啡，香气在店内萦绕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那这一杯，还要加点苏打水吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过喝完这一杯，恐怕今晚真的要睡不着觉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛尔，我先说明一下，我告诉过他们了，可是他们几个现在就是很想进这家店，可能是想尝一尝火山咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了弥补店主的损失，我可以留下一个今天博览会上的商品作为交换！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博览会的商品？是哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个可爱的小孩子送给我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！现在不能进店里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的生物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（拱进角落）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（掀翻箱子）"},{"type":"narration","text":"不安分的小羊从阿黛尔身边的杂物中拖出了一箱玻璃瓶，兴致勃勃地翻找着什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最终，它们衔着几枚从汽水瓶上掰下来的金属瓶盖，一副如获至宝的样子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......干什么？你们不是为了喝汽水吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小羊们蹦蹦跳跳，每一只都顶着一枚亮闪闪的瓶盖，排成一队，玩闹着跑向远方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都说了等一等，他们怎么比我还着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，这就是他们想找的“种子”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些瓶盖......为什么会是种子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们眼里的世界，和你们看到的是不太一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一粒粒小小圆圆的东西，被羽兽带去了异国他乡，生根发芽，变成了截然不同的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的成了汽水的盖子，有的成了酱料的盖子，每一种的味道都不一样，但又都各自有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概他们中有的在哥伦比亚喝过这种火山咖啡，所以印象深刻吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种看待世界的视角，难道不够有趣吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被落下的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刨土）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛尔","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算是这样......唉，你们把瓶盖埋进地里也不会长出饮料的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随他们去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案会自己长出来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我是科斯达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科斯达先生，我是您祖父的护理医生。我很抱歉，您的祖父，今天傍晚去世了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道该不该说是种安慰，他走得很安详。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
